Package: cookeR
Title: R Version and Environment Manager
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("noatgnu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A thin wrapper around the 'cooker' command-line tool, which installs
    and manages portable R runtimes and isolated package libraries. 'cooker' does
    the real work (downloading, verifying, and extracting R runtimes from
    'r-portable' releases); this package exposes it as ordinary R functions by
    shelling out to the binary and parsing its JSON output.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
Imports:
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
